# Route: guide 41 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to
# 59, 64 quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Undercity, Tirisfal Glades, Tanaris, Durotar, Badlands, Arathi
# Highlands, Eastern Plaguelands, The Hinterlands, Hillsbrad Foothills):
# Undercity -> near Undercity -> Undercity -> The Bulwark -> Gadgetzan ->
# Noonshade Ruins -> Gadgetzan -> Zul'Farrak -> Broken Pillar -> Lost Rigger
# Cove -> Sen'jin Village -> Valley of Trials -> Skull Rock -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Crimson Courier (6145; Crimson
# Courier 60); The Star, the Hand and the Heart (736; Grel'borg the Miser 39,
# Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44); Summoning the Princess (656;
# Myzrael 44); The Scarlet Oracle, Demetria (6148; Demetria 61); The Crown of
# Will (519; Targ 41, Muckrake 40, Glommus 39); The Crown of Will (520;
# Mug'thol 43).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Book of Ur (1013), The Book of Ur (1013), Going,
# Going, Guano! (1109), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Bring the End (3341), The
# Power to Destroy... (5725), Light's Justice (92421), Light's Justice
